'''Swords''' are a weapon classification of up-close-and-personal melee weapons that can be found and bought everywhere in ''Blox Fruits''.

Most swords have a focus on precise, close-ranged moves that deal high damage. All swords have two unique abilities, and some swords have imbued or skills that originate from their [[Blox Fruits|Blox Fruit]] counterpart (or from somewhere else).

All swords can also be [[Upgrading|upgraded]] via the [[Blacksmith]] and [[Enchantments|enchanted]] via the [[Dragon Talon Sage]] to deal extra damage or to gain unique abilities relative to the [[enchantments]].

==Obtainment==
There are several ways of obtaining swords, including:
* Buying swords from [[NPCs]].
* Drops from [[bosses]].
* Completing [[puzzles]] and tasks, although these are usually boss drops as well.
* In the case of [[Dark Blade]], players can obtain the [[Shop#Game Passes|Game Pass]] by purchasing it with {{Robux|Robux}}, receiving it as a gift, or trading for it.

